# An Evaluation of Foreign Fieldwork in Promoting Deep Learning: A Preliminary Investigation.

**Authors:** Hill, Jenny, Woodland, Wendy

## Abstract
Defined and evaluated the role of foreign fieldwork in promoting deep learning by university undergraduates of geography and environmental management. Found that students generally rose to the challenge of predictive-analytical learning; while some students began to question the acquisition of knowledge and came to realize its provisional nature, others had considerable difficulty in achieving deeper understanding through problem-solving activity. Understanding was ultimately individually constructed and often assessment-driven. (EV)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ664717

